        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonso badi basonga mpingu badi bantu badi babuelakana; malu adi abasankisha kaena mua kubakuatshisha; bamonyi babo kabena batangila, kabena bajingulula bualu ebu, bua bafuishibue bundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu kai wakufuanyikisha nzambi, anyi wakutula luhingu ludi kaluyi lumanye mua kumukuatshisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, bonso badi bakuata nʼandi mudimu eu nebafuishibue bundu, ne bena mudimu bandi badi anu bantu. Buonso buabo badisangishe hohamue, badimanyike; nebatshine, nebafuishibue bundu diatshimue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutudi udi uteka tshiamu tshia luhingu ha mutu ha makala a kahia, udi utshitula ne marteau, utshifula ne diboko diandi dikole. Nzala idi imusuma, bukole buandi budi buhanga; kena unua mai, udi ubanga kuhungila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muena mabaya udi uvungulula luidi luandi ha dibaya, udi ufundahu ne mutshi wa mukanda, udi udikona ne nkono, udi ufundahu tshidikishilu ne biamu bia compas, udi usonga luhingu ludi ne tshifuanyikishi tshia muntu, luikale ne bulengele bu bua muntu, bua luikale mu nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi uditahila mitshi ya cèdre, udi usungula mutshi wa rouvre anyi wa telebinta, udi ûlekela tô ne hakolau munkatshi mua mitshi ya muitu. Udi utentula mutshi wa cèdre, ne nvula idi yudiundisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mutshi eu newikaleku bua muntu kuwosha mu kahia. Udi wangata tshituha tshiau bu nkunyi, udi wota kahia; e, udi utemesha nʼatshi kahia, udi ulamba bidia. Bulelela, udi wenza nʼatshi nzambi, udi umutendelela; udi usonga nʼatshi luhingu, udi ulukukuila hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi wosha tshituha tshiau mu kahia; udi udia munyinyi udiye ulamba ne tshituha tshikuabo; udi wanyika munyinyi, udi ukuta biandi; udi wota kahia, udi wamba ne, Eyo, nakuota kahia, nakumona dinkenke dia kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi wenza nzambi, luhingu luandi lusonga mene, ne tshituha tshiau tshidi tshishala; udi umukukuila, udi umutendelela, udi umulomba malu ne, Umpandishe, bualu bua wewe udi nzambi wanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo kabena bamanye, kabena belangana meji; bualu bua yeye wakumana kubuikila mesu abo ne kabena mua kutangila; wakukanda mitshima yabo ne kabena mua kujingulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuena umue wabo udi uvuluka, ne kakuena lungenyi anyi dijingulula munda muandi bua kuambeye ne, Nakuosha tshituha mu kahia, nakulamba bidia ha mutu ha makala atshi; nakuanyikaku munyinyi, nakudia; nenvushe tshituha tshiau tshidi tshishala tshintu tshia kudinyanga nʼatshi, anyi? Nenkukuile tshibasa tshia mutshi, anyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
